Package: FuzzyRandom
Type: Package
Title: Level-Wise Statistics for Fuzzy Random Variables
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-06
Authors@R: c(person("Gunjan", "Aggrwal", comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-3213-4086"), role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gunjanuk1994@gmail.com"), person("Mukul", "Bijalwan", comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3040-6912"), role = "aut"), person("Mukul", "Jain", role = "aut"))
Description: Level-wise statistical methods for fuzzy random variables,
    implementing the Puri-Ralescu framework. Provides level-wise empirical
    distribution functions, moments, covariance and correlation, a level-wise
    Kolmogorov-Smirnov goodness-of-fit test, an approximate fuzzy normal
    distribution with simulation, and level-wise central limit theorem and law
    of large numbers inference. The package only depends on base R.
